      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "68546ce",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft supplies plastics that make vehicles lighter, safer, and more fuel efficient. Automotive and transportation companies choose our materials because they provide consistent quality and adaptability across cars, trucks, buses, trains, RVs, and marine applications.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Our plastics reduce vehicle weight while maintaining strength, cutting fuel consumption and emissions. They resist corrosion, impact, and wear, making them ideal for powertrain parts, body panels, glazing, and interior components. Transportation systems benefit from our durable plastics in bus windows, railcar panels, truck liners, and marine decking. Plastic-Craft helps manufacturers achieve long-term reliability, safety, and design flexibility in both consumer and commercial transport.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "89254f3",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
